## Why This Is Asked

This question tests cost-aware routing and per-tenant quotas, a practical constraint in real llm-ops gateways.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant budgets and token accounting
- Routing policy using model variants (fast/balanced/cheap)
- Fallback mechanisms and caching
- API surface and minimal test plan

## Code Example

```javascript
function route(request, budget, models){
  const t = request.tokens;
  if (budget.remaining < t) return {model: models.cheap, useCache:true};
  // choose model based on remaining budget
  // ...
  return {model: models.balanced, remaining: budget.remaining - t};
}
```

